 "fieldData": {
  "awb---faq-data": "<div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script> window.awbFAQ = {\"heading\": \"Contest Entry Form FAQ\", \"items\": [{\"q\": \"What is a contest entry form?\", \"a\": \"A contest entry form is the form people fill in to enter a contest, giveaway, or sweepstakes. It records who entered, how to reach them, and that they accepted the official rules. For a judged contest, it also carries the entry itself, such as a photo or a short story.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I create a contest entry form?\", \"a\": \"Write the official rules first, then describe the contest and who can enter in one prompt to Emergent's <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-form-builder'>AI form builder</a>. It builds the form and the database of entries behind it. Publish the rules at a link of their own and put that link on the form before you share it.\"}, {\"q\": \"What fields should a giveaway entry form include?\", \"a\": \"Keep it short: name, email, a birth date or age confirmation, state or country, and a required checkbox that links to the official rules. Add a phone number only if you plan to call winners. Ask for a shipping address from the winner after the draw, not from every entrant.\"}, {\"q\": \"What should I change in a contest entry form template before launch?\", \"a\": \"Change the fields to match your official rules: the minimum age, the states allowed, the entry limit, and the closing time. Then add the rules checkbox and a confirmation message that says when the winner is drawn. Pair the form with a <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-landing-page-builder/giveaway'>giveaway landing page</a> that shows the prize and the deadline next to a link to the rules.\"}, {\"q\": \"Does a sweepstakes entry form need different fields than a contest one?\", \"a\": \"Yes, when judges pick the contest winner. If the winner comes from a random draw, the form needs contact and eligibility fields only. If judges pick the winner, add a field for the entry itself and show the judging criteria beside it. Before you add any purchase or payment step, check the rules that apply to your promotion.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I handle duplicate entries on a contest entry form?\", \"a\": \"Have the form compare each new entry's email address with the entries already saved. Keep a repeat as a tagged row instead of removing it, which lets you answer an entrant who asks why only one entry counted. Forms built with Emergent have no response caps. A giveaway that draws thousands of entries keeps every row.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I get feedback from people who filled in my contest entry form?\", \"a\": \"Send a short follow-up form to everyone who entered once the winner is announced. Ask how they heard about the contest, whether the rules were clear, and whether they would enter again, each on a 1 to 5 scale. Keep it as brief as a <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-form-builder/training-feedback'>training feedback form</a>: three or four questions at most.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I pick a random winner from contest entry form responses?\", \"a\": \"Draw only from entries that passed your checks. Pick the alternates in the same draw and in order, and the second name is ready if the winner never replies. Keep the draw record until the prize is delivered, in case an entrant asks how the winner was chosen.\"}, {\"q\": \"Can contest entry forms accept photo and video uploads?\", \"a\": \"They can when you add an upload field. Make it a required field of its own, and accept only the file types your judges can open, such as JPG or MP4. Print the size limit next to the field where entrants see it before they upload. With Emergent, each upload lands in the same database row as the entrant's name and email, and you own that database.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I contact the winner from a contest entry form?\", \"a\": \"Email the winner at the address on their entry, with a deadline to reply and a request to confirm their age and state against the eligibility rules. Once they confirm, collect a shipping address for the prize. If the prize is cash and your finance team pays by check, send it through a <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-form-builder/check-request'>check request form</a> with the winner's details attached.\"}]}; </script></div></div>",
  "afb---prompt": "<p>Build a contest entry form that saves every response to a database I own.</p><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script> window.awbPrompt = {\"default\": \"Build a contest entry form that saves every response to a database I own.\", \"chips\": [{\"label\": \"Eligibility Checks\", \"add\": \"Add eligibility checks for a minimum age and allowed states before an entry is saved.\"}, {\"label\": \"Duplicate Entries\", \"add\": \"Add a duplicate tag to entries that reuse an email, and leave them out of the count.\"}, {\"label\": \"Winner Draw\", \"add\": \"Add a winner draw that picks one winner and two alternates from valid entries.\"}, {\"label\": \"Referral Entries\", \"add\": \"Add referral entries: one per friend who enters through a share link, up to five.\"}]}; </script></div></div>"
 }
